<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Support - Rune</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light;
            --bg: #f6f7fb;
            --card: #ffffff;
            --text: #16181d;
            --muted: #5e6573;
            --accent: #2563eb;
            --border: #d9dfeb;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eef4ff 0%, var(--bg) 100%);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 860px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 48px 20px 64px;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.06);
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }

        .muted {
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        a {
            color: var(--accent);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <section class="card">
            <h1>Support Rune</h1>
            <p>Pour toute question, probleme technique ou demande d'assistance concernant l'application Rune, vous pouvez nous contacter a l'adresse suivante :</p>
            <p><a href="mailto:contact@rune-app.com">contact@rune-app.com</a></p>
            <p class="muted">Nous ferons notre maximum pour vous repondre rapidement.</p>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
